 ourselves because of the elephants.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילדות שואלות את עצמן לאן הלכו הילדים.","en":"The girls ask themselves where the boys went to.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני יודעת שאת יודעת מה את רוצָה מעצמךְ.","en":"I know that you know what you want from yourself.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו לומדים לתת לעצמנו לשכוח את כל מה שאמרנו.","en":"We are learning to let ourselves forget everything we have said.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התלמידים אומרים לעצמם מילים חיוביות לפני המבחן.","en":"The students tell themselves positive words before the test.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו כותבים לעצמנו פתקים כשאנחנו רוצים לזכור דברים.","en":"We write ourselves notes when we want to remember things.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"את":"it / that / the fruit","עצמכן":"yourselves (f.p)","הוא":"(he) is / (it) is / he","חושב":"I think so / is thinking / think","הציגו":"present / show","עצמכם":"yourself / yourselves / yourselves (m.p)","זאת":"it is (feminine) / that / that is (feminine)","אתה":"you / you are / you (m.s)","משקר":"i, you, he, it (m.s - pres.)","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","מחפש":"looking / looks for / searches","עצמי":"myself","היא":"her / it / she","אוהבת":"like / likes / love","עצמה":"herself / itself","אתן":"you / I will give, allow","אוהבות":"love(s) (f.p - pres.)","למה":"why / why?","בעצמךְ":"by yourself","נותן":"give / is giving / lets","יותר":"any longer / any more / more","לפעמים":"sometimes","מפחד":"afraid / is scared / scared","עצמו":"himself","אמר":"said, told","לי":"I have / for me / me","זה":"it / it is / it's","הן":"are / they / they are","רואות":"see / see (f.p - pres.)","עצמן":"themselves (f.p)","הם":"are / they / they are","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","חושבים":"are thinking / think","רק":"just / only","על":"about / at / by","עצמם":"themselves (m.p)","אתם":"do you want / you / you are","מכירה":"selling","יכול":"can / it's possible / maybe","לעשות":"do / nothing can be done / there is nothing to do","הכל":"all / everything / everything